{"text":"建義元年十一月廿三日，比丘尼道慧石浮圖一區。願一切法界有刑之伴口勉苦患。有願己身涅洹，貧乏苦惱衆生，一時成佛。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"道慧","refId":null,"text":"道慧","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"苦","refId":null,"text":"苦患","start":33,"end":35},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"苦","refId":null,"text":"苦惱","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":47,"end":49}]}